+(ae4bb79885), which 4b98747213 by Ørjan Malde replaces with the drive.
+Left out: 4b98747213's hunk in hw/ppc/prep.c, which reads "persistent"
+for LEMU's 40p NVRAM handling, not in QEMU 11.1.3. Carried as the base
+of wsh/0059, which gives the sysbus M48Txx the same storage.
