+region at 0xf.df00_0000, a walking one through a tag (bits 31-20 back)
+and a data word (all bits), a tag per 32-byte line (another offset in
+the line reads the line's tag, the next line its own, the last line),
+a data word per word up to the last one, and the VMEbus control
+register still reads 0. 10 cases in all; vme-ioc fails without the
+patch before.
